  "description": "HarfBuzz-backed text shaping for DocWright. Install this if you render Arabic, Hebrew or Indic scripts — without a shaper, complex text is drawn as individual unjoined characters. This is the one DocWright package with a native dependency (HarfBuzzSharp), which is exactly why shaping is opt-in rather than built in; Latin, Cyrillic and Greek text does not need it.",
